  "concubinage3aClauseEducational": "Without a beneficiary clause naming your partner, your pillar 3a follows the legal order of beneficiaries (OPP3 art. 2) and your partner is not a beneficiary by default. With a clause filed with your 3a foundation, you can name them there.",
