  "coachGreetingRandom1": "Your 3a — did you actually choose it? Or did 'some guy' choose it for you?",
  "@coachGreetingRandom1": {
    "description": "Coach chat random greeting message 1 of 20."
  },
  "coachGreetingRandom2": "In Switzerland, we don't talk about money. We lose it in silence.",
  "@coachGreetingRandom2": {
    "description": "Coach chat random greeting message 2 of 20."
  },
  "coachGreetingRandom3": "The guy who sold you your 3a got his commission year one. You're still waiting for your return.",
  "@coachGreetingRandom3": {
    "description": "Coach chat random greeting message 3 of 20."
  },
  "coachGreetingRandom4": "Your banker knows you better than you do. That's not a compliment.",
  "@coachGreetingRandom4": {
    "description": "Coach chat random greeting message 4 of 20."
  },
  "coachGreetingRandom5": "Everyone tells you to buy. Your banker, your parents, your brother-in-law. Ever asked someone who sells nothing?",
  "@coachGreetingRandom5": {
    "description": "Coach chat random greeting message 5 of 20."
  },
  "coachGreetingRandom6": "At 25, you're already paying into retirement. At 25, you don't even know you're paying into retirement.",
  "@coachGreetingRandom6": {
    "description": "Coach chat random greeting message 6 of 20."
  },
  "coachGreetingRandom7": "You don't manage your finances. You avoid them. There's a difference.",
  "@coachGreetingRandom7": {
    "description": "Coach chat random greeting message 7 of 20."
  },
  "coachGreetingRandom8": "Do you know how much you'll get at retirement? Nobody does.",
  "@coachGreetingRandom8": {
    "description": "Coach chat random greeting message 8 of 20."
  },
  "coachGreetingRandom9": "If your salary stops tomorrow — do you know what happens?",
  "@coachGreetingRandom9": {
    "description": "Coach chat random greeting message 9 of 20."
  },
  "coachGreetingRandom10": "Your insurer sees one piece. Your banker too. Your accountant too. The full picture? No one.",
  "@coachGreetingRandom10": {
    "description": "Coach chat random greeting message 10 of 20."
  },
  "coachGreetingRandom11": "How many things have you signed without reading?",
  "@coachGreetingRandom11": {
    "description": "Coach chat random greeting message 11 of 20."
  },
  "coachGreetingRandom12": "Have you ever actually opened your pension certificate? Really opened it?",
  "@coachGreetingRandom12": {
    "description": "Coach chat random greeting message 12 of 20."
  },
  "coachGreetingRandom13": "Your savings are sleeping. Do you know how much that costs?",
  "@coachGreetingRandom13": {
    "description": "Coach chat random greeting message 13 of 20."
  },
  "coachGreetingRandom14": "The Swiss retirement system is excellent. It's just that nobody gave you the manual.",
  "@coachGreetingRandom14": {
    "description": "Coach chat random greeting message 14 of 20."
  },
  "coachGreetingRandom15": "You switch jobs, you check the salary. You never check the pension fund.",
  "@coachGreetingRandom15": {
    "description": "Coach chat random greeting message 15 of 20."
  },
  "coachGreetingRandom16": "Withdraw your 3a and your pension the same year? Tax explodes. Spread them out? It melts. Same money. Just timing.",
  "@coachGreetingRandom16": {
    "description": "Coach chat random greeting message 16 of 20."
  },
  "coachGreetingRandom17": "An LPP buyback can affect your tax and retirement projection. Your certificate lets us quantify it.",
  "@coachGreetingRandom17": {
    "description": "Coach chat random greeting message 17 of 20."
  },
  "coachGreetingRandom18": "Direct or indirect amortization? If you don't know the difference, you've been overpaying taxes. Since day one.",
  "@coachGreetingRandom18": {
    "description": "Coach chat random greeting message 18 of 20."
  },
  "coachGreetingRandom19": "You're self-employed. Nobody contributes for you anymore. Everything needs building. Have you started?",
  "@coachGreetingRandom19": {
    "description": "Coach chat random greeting message 19 of 20."
  },
  "coachGreetingRandom20": "To buy property, you take part of your pension fund and put it in the walls. What does future-you think about that?",
  "@coachGreetingRandom20": {
    "description": "Coach chat random greeting message 20 of 20."
  },
